## 📚 Tecnologias

| Categoria | Tecnologia |
|-----------|------------|
| **Frontend** | React 18, @xyflow/react, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS |
| **Backend** | Node.js 20, Express, TypeScript |
| **Player** | Vanilla TypeScript, hls.js |
| **Processamento** | FFmpeg (HLS multi-bitrate) |
| **Banco de Dados** | PostgreSQL 16 |
| **Analytics** | PostgreSQL + REST + dashboard React (editor) |
| **DevOps** | Docker, Docker Compose, Nginx |

